        "original_id": "af0e9e05-ca9a-5363-ac0d-d204ea012dec",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tuppence Middleton, Selina Cadell, Tom Hughes, Alex Jennings, Diarmuid Lawrence\n- Organizations: BBC, Masterpiece Films, Netflix\n- Products: The Lady Vanishes (2013 film), Sense8\n- Roles: Iris Carr, Miss Froy, Max Hare, the Professor, Riley Blue\n- Topics: British television mystery thriller films, English actresses\n\nFacts:\n- Tuppence Middleton was born on 21 February 1987.\n- Tuppence Middleton is an English actress.\n- The Lady Vanishes is a 2013 British television mystery thriller film directed by Diarmuid Lawrence.\n- The Lady Vanishes was a co-production of the BBC and Masterpiece Films.\n- Selina Cadell starred in The Lady Vanishes as Miss Froy, the disappearing woman.\n- Tuppence Middleton starred in The Lady Vanishes as Iris Carr, a young woman who discovers Miss Froy's disappearance but is not taken seriously.\n- Tom Hughes and Alex Jennings starred in The Lady Vanishes as Max Hare and the Professor, two fellow English passengers who help Iris Carr.\n- Since 2015, Tuppence Middleton has portrayed Riley Blue in the Netflix webseries Sense8.",
